<title>UK: Banco America do Sul to launch $70 mln Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Banco America do Sul to launch $70 mln Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Banco America do Sul SA will issue a $70 million three-year Eurobond later on Thursday, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>The deal will be priced to yield 250 basis points over U.S. Treasury notes. The notes will be listed in Luxembourg and issued off an EMTN programme.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
